\newlabel{fig:sample}{{1.1}{4}{Conditional shift in the \texttt {Shift3DIdent} dataset. It appears that the objects in the two images of the leftmost column have the same colour. However, each image was generated by a different combination of object-colour, spotlight-colour: One teapot is actually orange, while the other is bright green. We can see this by looking at other examples of the same objects under different lighting conditions. The images to the right depict different views of the same corresponding object}{figure.caption.2}{}}
